<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Umax Jan-Sept net at T$380 mln.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Umax Jan-Sept net at T$380 mln.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan manufacturer Umax Data Systems Inc reported a net profit of T$380 million on turnover of T$3.776 billion during the first nine months of 1996, the firm said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A company spokesman told Reuters comparison figures for 1995 were not available because the firm was only listed on the Taiwan Stock Exchange in January 1996.</p>
<p>Umax has set a 1996 net profit target of T$564 million on sales of T$6.235 billion.</p>
<p>The statement said the company has enjoyed good sales for its main products, image scanners.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
